# Cognis Docker setup reference.
# Runtime defaults are grouped under docker/env/:
#   defaults.env     shared application defaults
#   postgres.env     PostgreSQL service and connection settings
#   production.env   production-only secrets and overrides
#   development.env  local-development overrides
#
# Review the selected files before deployment. In particular, replace the
# blank database URL, password, and encryption key in production.env.
# Docker Compose loads the appropriate files automatically.
